  "gh:content": {
    "en": "“Yes. I am master of my body. I trained it and guarded it with discipline. I grew up in a mining town, lent my body to the military preparatory corps, then to mission at the space agency. I trained not to cry.”",
    "ja": "短い沈黙。"
  },
